    - we have 3 resolvers that deal with files
        - md resolver has fallback to shared logic, uses Filelist which contain File 
            - this should become a bottom level thing
        - repo and manifest resolvers both use Filesets
            - this is already a bottom level thing. do Fileset class need an attr to say source? 
                - It can default to pud
                - and optionally by some flag var work off of shared instead
            - then improves semantics of yaml?

